abstract: >-
  Compilation, exact audit, public documentation, visualization, and
  reproducible SymPy, SageMath, and Magma certificates for a dimension-three
  Keller map with a three-point reduced fiber. Mathematical provenance is
  recorded separately and does not belong to the repository author.
